        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The player is drawn into the world of Dead Island on the brink of a mysterious epidemic that suddenly, and without warning, breaks out on the fictional island of Banoi. As a guest of the Royal Palms Resort, the player's stay was supposed to be a dream holiday; a luxurious getaway to the beautiful beaches of a tropical paradise. But faced with the reality of a zombie apocalypse, there is only one thing left to do: Survive. This is Dead Island; a paradise to die for.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El jugador se adentra en el mundo de Dead Island en vísperas de una misteriosa epidemia que estalla de repente y sin previo aviso en la ficticia isla de Banoi. Como huésped del Royal Palms Resort, su estancia iba a ser unas vacaciones de ensueño: una escapada de lujo a las hermosas playas de un paraíso tropical. Pero frente a la realidad de un apocalipsis zombi, solo queda una cosa por hacer: sobrevivir. Esto es Dead Island, un paraíso por el que morir.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2011",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
