        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Time for some 16-bit retro revenge! Hell-bent on saving his cat, Max must carve a bloody path through a zombie-infested California, tearing his way through hordes of the undead, battalions of corrupt soldiers, and a slew of evil-minded ex-cons. Pull off crazy combos, collect power-ups, wield super weapons, and unleash insane magic attacks as you fight to become the amazing 16-bit side-scrolling hero you've always believed yourself to be!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡Es hora de una venganza retro de 16 bits! Empeñado en salvar a su gato, Max debe abrirse un camino sangriento a través de una California infestada de zombis, desgarrando hordas de no muertos, batallones de soldados corruptos y un montón de exconvictos de mentalidad malvada. Ejecuta combos locos, recoge potenciadores, empuña superarmas y desata ataques mágicos desmesurados mientras luchas por convertirte en el increíble héroe de desplazamiento lateral de 16 bits que siempre has creído ser.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2016",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
